      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe this is not the right place, but we we will not get feedback for invalid parameters, which would be nice - logging or even returning 400 or raising exception would be fine with me.  For example, if I enqueue with a mistyped multi-select value, it will silently get dropped.\n\nI do not see required parameters enforced.\n\nAlso maybe raise an exception if I try to enqueue with parameters but the config has none.\n\nShould we prefix variable names?  Will we be able to override important variables with this?",
